// 由逆向管线从 semantics.L0.glb 生成（L0）。~fit 是拟合度，~err 是相对误差；mesh 是拟合不了、直接引用源网格的部件

material ground color=#6b7360 metal=0.05 rough=1
material water color=#4f7fae metal=0.05 rough=0.15
material stone color=#9a958c metal=0.05 rough=0.78
material wood color=#8a5a3c metal=0.05 rough=0.78
material metal color=#59636d metal=0.6 rough=0.4
material plain color=#cfcabe metal=0.05 rough=0.78
material tile color=#a8473a metal=0.05 rough=0.78
material brick color=#b5654a metal=0.05 rough=0.78
material glass color=#9cc3e0 metal=0.3 rough=0.2
material leaf color=#4f7d45 metal=0.05 rough=0.78

box ground size=120,1,90 at=0,-1,0 mat=ground ~fit=1 ~src="ground" ~role="terrain"
box street_h4_core size=7,10.6,5.8 on=ground offset=43,0,8 mat=brick ~fit=1 ~src="street.h4.skin.core" ~role="terrain"
repeat trees_4 n=3 step=0,0,6.5 on=ground offset=-43.788,0,13.75 pin=origin {
  cyl trunk r=0.24 h=2.4 mat=wood ~fit=0.914
  sphere crown r=1.28 on=trunk[0,1,0] mat=leaf ~fit=0.9236
}
box street_h1_door size=1.2,2.2,0.2 on=ground offset=29,0,-5.2 mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h1.door"
box street_h3_door size=1.2,2.2,0.2 on=ground offset=29,0,10.8 mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h3.door"
box street_h2_door size=1.2,2.2,0.2 on=ground offset=43,0,-5.2 mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h2.door"
repeat trees n=3 step=0,0,6.5 on=ground offset=-22.788,0,13.75 pin=origin {
  cyl trunk r=0.348 h=3.48 mat=wood ~fit=0.9157
  sphere crown r=1.856 on=trunk mat=leaf ~fit=0.9246
}
box river size=90,0.05,30 on=ground turn=-90 mat=water ~fit=1 ~src="river"
box street_h3_body size=7,6,5.6 on=ground offset=29,0,7.9 mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h3.body" ~role="terrain"
box street_h2_body size=7,6,5.6 on=ground offset=43,0,-8.1 mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h2.body" ~role="terrain"
box street_h1_body size=7,3,5.6 on=ground offset=29,0,-8.1 mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h1.body" ~role="terrain"
repeat watch_legs n=(2,1,2) step=3,0,3 on=ground offset=-34.5,0,-21.75 pin=origin {
  box leg size=0.3,9,0.3 mat=plain ~fit=1
}
repeat watch2_legs n=(2,1,2) step=3,0,3 on=ground offset=-19.5,0,-29.4 pin=origin {
  box leg size=0.3,9,0.3 mat=plain ~fit=1
}
repeat trees_3 n=3 step=0,0,6.5 on=ground offset=-36.788,0,13.75 pin=origin {
  cyl trunk r=0.276 h=2.76 mat=wood ~fit=0.9142
  sphere crown r=1.472 on=trunk mat=leaf ~fit=0.9243
}
repeat trees_2 n=3 step=0,0,6.5 on=ground offset=-29.788,0,13.75 pin=origin {
  cyl trunk r=0.312 h=3.12 mat=wood ~fit=0.9149
  sphere crown r=1.664 on=trunk mat=leaf ~fit=0.9223
}
repeat piers n=4 step=0,0,-9.3333 on=river offset=-14,0,0 pin=origin {
  cyl p r=0.9 h=5 mat=stone ~fit=0.9192
}
box rampW size=13.2636,0.5,6 at=ground offset=-23.787,2.873,0 rot=(0,0,1,25.21262) mat=stone ~fit=1 ~src="rampW"
box rampE size=13.2636,0.5,6 at=ground offset=23.787,2.873,0 rot=(0,0,-1,25.21262) mat=stone ~fit=1 ~src="rampE"
box crate size=1.5,1.5,1.5 at=-18,2.5,13.5 mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="crate" ~role="decor"
wedge street_h1_half size=3.5,2.2,5.6 on=street_h1_body[-0.5,1,0] mat=tile ~fit=1 ~src="street.h1.half" ~role="terrain"
mirror street_h1_half2 of=street_h1_half across=street_h1_body axis=x ~role="terrain"
box street_h4_win_0_pane size=1.1,1.5,0.12 against=street_h4_core[-0.606,-0.189,1] mat=glass ~fit=1 ~src="street.h4.skin.win.0.pane" ~role="terrain"
box street_h4_win_1_pane size=1.1,1.5,0.12 against=street_h4_core[0,-0.189,1] mat=glass ~fit=1 ~src="street.h4.skin.win.1.pane" ~role="terrain"
box street_h4_win_2_pane size=1.1,1.5,0.12 against=street_h4_core[0.606,-0.189,1] mat=glass ~fit=1 ~src="street.h4.skin.win.2.pane" ~role="terrain"
repeat slab_pl n=40 step=0.9,0,0 at=rampW offset=6.344,2.451,0 pin=origin {
  box plank size=6,0.6,0.82 turn=-90 mat=wood ~fit=1
}
repeat lamps n=4 step=0,0,-9.3333 on=slab_pl.4.plank[0.8,1,0.122] pin=origin {
  cyl pole r=0.12 h=4 mat=metal ~fit=0.9088
  sphere bulb r=0.35 on=pole mat=metal ~fit=0.9241
}
repeat rails n=(12,1,2) step=3.1304,0,5.6 at=slab_pl.0.plank[-0.9333,1,-0.811] pin=origin {
  cyl post r=0.08 h=1.1 mat=metal ~fit=0.9122
}
box street_h4_win_3_pane size=1.1,1.5,0.12 against=street_h4_core[-0.606,0.264,1] mat=glass ~fit=1 ~src="street.h4.skin.win.3.pane" ~role="terrain"
box street_h4_win_4_pane size=1.1,1.5,0.12 against=street_h4_core[0,0.264,1] mat=glass ~fit=1 ~src="street.h4.skin.win.4.pane" ~role="terrain"
box street_h4_win_5_pane size=1.1,1.5,0.12 against=street_h4_core[0.606,0.264,1] mat=glass ~fit=1 ~src="street.h4.skin.win.5.pane" ~role="terrain"
wedge street_h3_half size=3.5,2.2,5.6 on=street_h3_body[-0.5,1,0] mat=tile ~fit=1 ~src="street.h3.half" ~role="terrain"
mirror street_h3_half2 of=street_h3_half across=street_h1_body axis=x ~role="terrain"
wedge street_h2_half size=3.5,2.2,5.6 on=street_h2_body[-0.5,1,0] mat=tile ~fit=1 ~src="street.h2.half" ~role="terrain"
wedge street_h2_half2 size=3.5,2.2,5.6 on=street_h2_body[0.5,1,0] turn=180 mat=tile ~fit=1 ~src="street.h2.half2" ~role="terrain"
box street_h3_chimney size=0.8,3,0.8 on=street_h3_body[0.55,1,0.3] mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h3.chimney" ~role="terrain"
box street_h2_chimney size=0.8,3,0.8 on=street_h2_body[0.55,1,0.3] mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h2.chimney" ~role="terrain"
box watch_cabin size=5,2.5,5 on=watch_legs.0.leg[10,1,10] mat=wood ~fit=1 ~src="watch.cabin"
box watch2_cabin size=4.2,2.5,4.2 on=watch2_legs.0.leg[10,1,10] mat=wood ~fit=1 ~src="watch2.cabin"
box street_h4_parapet size=7.3,0.6,6.1 on=street_h4_core mat=plain ~fit=1 ~src="street.h4.skin.parapet"
wedge watch_cap size=5,1.5,5.4 on=watch_cabin mat=tile ~fit=1 ~src="watch.cap"
repeat watch2_rail n=(2,1,2) step=3.8,0,3.8 on=watch2_cabin offset=-1.9,0,-1.9 pin=origin {
  cyl post r=0.06 h=1 mat=plain ~fit=0.9119
}
